From: Altium-on-Wine kit
Subject: d2d1: cache canonical primitives and batch ordered solid draws

Base: Wine 11.16 with kit patch 0003. Opt-in with WINE_D2D_PRIMITIVE_CACHE=1
and WINE_D2D_BATCH=1. Preserve draw order, clips and fallback boundaries.

